De boom staat op de erfgrens. De buren hebben schriftelijk ingestemd.

The plain sibling of reply-to-request: same mechanism, different case. It exists so that
`await-reply` can be triggered more than once without resetting anything, and so that the
correlation is visibly selective rather than looking like "any reply resumes everything".

`References` names <fixture-02-html-alternative@example.org>, so this resumes the case that
02-html-alternative.eml started and leaves the cases from 03, 05 and 06 parked where they
are. Send this one and reply-to-request in either order and watch two different cases move
on.
